{"unit_id":"qw2007__dsh-incident-journal#card-zh","repo":"qw2007/dsh-incident-journal","commit":"9535725dc1d9719c762488aa959e84b805e05ae","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Incident Journal 是面向 DSH 的工程经验日志技能包，提供记录、复习、审计、资料整理和目录布局五种技能。provider 将技能目录注册到 DSH 的 skills registry，并按需读取技能说明；记录流程把踩坑、技术点和设计立场整理为可迁移条目，复习流程生成问题，审计流程检查索引与条目状态，资料技能整理外部参考，布局技能协助重命名日志目录。适合希望沉淀工程经验并周期复习的开发者。需要配置本地日志库路径，不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-153","skills/incident-journal/SKILL.md:1-35","skills/incident-review/SKILL.md:1-30","skills/incident-audit/SKILL.md:1-28"]}
{"unit_id":"qw2007__dsh-incident-journal#card-en","repo":"qw2007/dsh-incident-journal","commit":"9535725dc1d9719c762488aa959e84b805e05ae","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Incident Journal is a DSH pack for engineering lessons. It registers five skills for journaling, review, audit, sources, and layout. Users can record lessons, quiz themselves, inspect indexes, collect materials, and rename directories. A local journal root is required; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-153","skills/incident-journal/SKILL.md:1-35"]}
