{"unit_id":"qw2007__dsh-incident-journal#feature-1","repo":"qw2007/dsh-incident-journal","commit":"9535725dc1d9719c762488aa959e84b805e05ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"技能「incident-journal」：把踩坑、技术点或设计立场写成可迁移的条目，并更新日志索引。用户描述值得记录的经验后，技能检查资格和重复项，再生成条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/incident-journal/SKILL.md:1-35"]}
{"unit_id":"qw2007__dsh-incident-journal#feature-2","repo":"qw2007/dsh-incident-journal","commit":"9535725dc1d9719c762488aa959e84b805e05ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"技能「incident-review」：从日志中挑选条目生成复习问题，帮助用户检验对经验机制的记忆。用户请求复习后按条目状态选择 5–8 个问题，并将题目追加到 REVIEW.md。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/incident-review/SKILL.md:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"qw2007__dsh-incident-journal#feature-3","repo":"qw2007/dsh-incident-journal","commit":"9535725dc1d9719c762488aa959e84b805e05ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"技能「incident-audit」：检查经验库索引完整性、反事实内容、引用和分类失衡，并报告发现而不自动修改。用户请求审计时扫描库内条目和索引。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/incident-audit/SKILL.md:1-28"]}
{"unit_id":"qw2007__dsh-incident-journal#feature-4","repo":"qw2007/dsh-incident-journal","commit":"9535725dc1d9719c762488aa959e84b805e05ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"技能「incident-resource」：把外部参考材料按来源去重并收录到资料目录，更新资料索引，再报告相关条目。用户提供材料和来源后执行整理。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/incident-resource/SKILL.md:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"qw2007__dsh-incident-journal#feature-5","repo":"qw2007/dsh-incident-journal","commit":"9535725dc1d9719c762488aa959e84b805e05ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"技能「incident-layout」：重命名日志库中的目录并更新布局覆盖表及相关引用。用户说明目标目录名后执行布局调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/incident-layout/SKILL.md:1-30"]}
